Z||000002||FieroFanaticus2||10-25-2001||07:16 AM||||The movie about the Farm boy who is going to get married to a really hot chick but has had a dream about buying a kit car for years.  So he goes to buy it and the sales woman talks him into buying all the options he can't afford, but the owner of the company has been using bogus parts to build the cars with.  On his way home his car takes a dump on him and he goes back to complain.  Then it becomes an action movie.  He scores with the sales woman, blows up the factory, his car gets 'paid in full' as a wedding gift from his one time mistriss sales woman, and he gets married at the end.<BR>But his father and father in law battle over what field of business he will be in.  I think it's either oil or manuer.  Good Movie.<P>Not bad since I saw that once about 8 years ago.||||reg||1
